messages.content:
Convert this CSV data into a single JSON object that satisfies the JSON schema below. Respond with the JSON only.

CSV:
item,amount,unit
rice,400,g
chicken thighs,600,g
onion,1,piece
saffron,0.5,g
olive oil,3,tbsp

Schema:
{
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "name",
    "servings",
    "ingredients",
    "steps"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "ingredients": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "item",
          "amount",
          "unit"
        ]
      }
    },
    "steps": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    }
  }
}
